          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula la distribución estadística del número de períodos de observación médica por paciente:\n\n```sql\nWITH PatientObservationPeriods AS (\n    SELECT\n        person_id,\n        COUNT(observation_period_id) AS num_observation_periods\n    FROM\n        `observation_period`\n    GROUP BY\n        person_id\n)\nSELECT\n    CAST(AVG(num_observation_periods) AS BIGNUMERIC) AS mean_observation_periods,\n    MIN(num_observation_periods) AS min_observation_periods,\n    MAX(num_observation_periods) AS max_observation_periods,\n    APPROX_QUANTILES(num_observation_periods, 100)[OFFSET(25)] AS percentile_25,\n    APPROX_QUANTILES(num_observation_periods, 100)[OFFSET(50)] AS percentile_50,\n    APPROX_QUANTILES(num_observation_periods, 100)[OFFSET(75)] AS percentile_75\nFROM\n    PatientObservationPeriods;\n```"
          }
        ],
